{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"mpi k means collective center update mpi k means collective center update","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","fileName":"MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"MPI K-Means Collective Center Update","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 22:06\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[C++ Specialized Clustering Implementations]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["C++ Specialized Clustering Implementations","dataclusteringincplusplus.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"mpi k means collective center update mpi k means collective center update","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","fileName":"MPI K-Means Collective Center Update.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"MPI K-Means Collective Center Update","heading":"MPI K-Means Collective Center Update","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"During each parallel iteration, every process calculates local membership changes, coordinate sums, and cluster sizes. Collective all-reduce operations add those vectors across ranks, after which every process divides global sums by global sizes to obtain identical new centers.\n\nWhen convergence ends, workers send membership vectors to the master and a reduction collects objective contributions. Communication cost and serial input or output limit the speedup even when assignment work scales across processors.","tags":["baby"],"links":["C++ Specialized Cluster